# Grid B — U9 Error-handling surface (prospective, not reactive)
#
# Gap target: the root_cause scenario is reactive ("why did X
# fail") — prospective error-surface questions ("how does X handle
# Y") get squeezed into root_cause or architecture_explain, neither
# of which builds the evidence plan around enumerating error branches.
#
# Ground truth (internal/agent/agent.go): executeTool calls
# validateAnalyzerPrescanToolCall before dispatching the tool in
# StageAnalyze. When the validator returns non-nil, the tool call is
# rejected and the LLM gets an error message back. Answer must name
# both functions + the rejection path (error message returned to LLM,
# not silently dropped).
ID="u9a"
NAME="error handling — validateAnalyzerPrescanToolCall rejection path"
QUESTION="BaseAgent.executeTool 调用 validateAnalyzerPrescanToolCall 返回非 nil 错误时，调用流程走哪条分支？tool 调用被直接 reject，还是先执行再 override？"
# 2026-05-04 strictness audit: previous EC was the 2 question
# function names — bar = "复述题目函数名". The question asks the
# binary decision (reject vs execute-then-override). Tighten to
# require the answer to surface (a) the rejection verdict word
# AND (b) the "before-execution" timing — proving the answer
# reached the actual control-flow site.
#
# 2026-05-08 broaden: real eval surfaced equivalent phrasings the
# original alternation missed:
#   - "early return" (from BaseAgent.executeTool's literal control
#     flow — gate fires THEN return before tool dispatch)
#   - "early-return" (hyphenated)
#   - "rejected before" / "rejected prior to"
#   - "拦截" (Chinese "intercept" — semantic peer of "reject before")
# All these are valid phrasings of "rejection happens BEFORE tool
# execution". Broaden line 2 to accept; the binary-decision
# constraint stays (line 1 reject/拒绝/denied/blocked still required).
EXPECT_CONTAINS="executeTool validateAnalyzerPrescanToolCall"
# 2026-05-09 third-pass broaden: real eval kept finding semantic
# synonyms the alternation didn't cover. Model wrote "执行流直接短路"
# / "在真正执行工具前" / "完全绕过了工具注册表查找" / "不会被 Dispatch
# 到注册表" / "不会触发任何工具执行代码" / "中止后续所有执行逻辑" —
# all are valid "rejection happens BEFORE tool dispatch" phrasings
# in Chinese. Add: 短路 (short-circuit), 绕过 (bypass), 不会(被)?
# (.*Dispatch|执行|触发) (won't get dispatched / executed / triggered),
# 中止.*执行 (abort execution), 工具.*前 / 执行.*前 (before tool /
# before execution).
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(reject|拒绝|denied|blocked)
(before|pre.?dispatch|prior to|未执行|未调用|early.?return|拦截|短路|绕过|不会.*(Dispatch|执行|触发)|中止.*执行|(工具|执行).*前|先于.*执行)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="ignore swallow silent"
